  "title": "Lovely Russian Fish Pilaf",
  "description": "A traditional Russian one-pot dish featuring fish, ground cardamom, and shio-koji cure, cooked to perfection in a wok. This pescatarian-friendly recipe is perfect for a weeknight dinner.",
