  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large wok over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and carrot and cook until they are softened.",
    "Add the cod fish pieces and cook until they are browned.",
    "Add the ground cardamom, shio-koji cure, rice, and water to the wok.",
    "Stir well to combine and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover the wok, and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Turn off the heat and let the pilaf rest for 5 minutes.",
    "Fluff the pilaf with a fork and serve hot."
